            <div class="stat-number">63 <span class="unit">项</span></div>
            <div class="stat-name">国家知识产权局专利</div>
            <div class="stat-sub">✔ 翡翠绿授权状态全景收录</div>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-box">
            <div class="stat-number">65 <span class="unit">位</span></div>
